{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065766/block/singleImage/3278332/df/01M89K3VE938WZB58D5MVB1H4X.jpg?updatedAt=1795618463\"/><figcaption>上車客485萬購西沙SIERRA SEA一房 業主9個月獲利兩成｜二手成交</figcaption></figure><p>中原地產馬鞍山迎海御峰分行資深區域營業經理胡耀祖表示，近日交投氣氛向好，西沙 SIERRA SEA 本月暫錄約 33 宗二手買賣，屋苑最新錄得第 2A 期 2 座高層 J 室，單位實用面積約 299 方呎，一房間隔。 胡耀祖指，單位原開價約 500 萬元放售，議價後減價 15 萬元，以 485 萬元沽出，呎價約 16,221 元。新買家為上車客，見單位間隔合用，價錢合理，即決定入市單位自用。 據了解，原業主於 2026 年 2 月以 402 萬元購入單位，持貨約 9 個月轉手，帳面獲利 83 萬元或約 20.6% 離場。 即睇西沙 SIERRA SEA 放盤 (House730)</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065766/block/singleImage/3278338/wm/01M89K4Q2GTSQPNV5BBKNS1JFQ.jpeg?updatedAt=1795618463\"/><figcaption>SIERRA SEA本月暫錄約33宗二手買賣。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T05:41:21.533355+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":361,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T04:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T03:57:15.421049+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T05:34:44.413222+00:00","content_hash":"e905a6e5fb81c2836d4e30808a88010f063b26f5371184ca9b13f4b1e0c6c562","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T05:41:21.533355+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}